{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226700","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226700","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1422670001:1":{"text":"여러분이 오시기 전에... 타란 강이... 그 흐름으로... 사슴 영혼의 인도를 전해줬어요.","source_cn":"在你们到来之前……塔兰河……已经用它的水流……向我传达...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4248D2B1E7412B74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422670002:1":{"text":"추, 추방당했던 이들은... 긴 여정을 마친 몸을... 강물에 씻어내야 해요.","source_cn":"被、被驱逐的子民……需要将远行的躯体……浸入河川当中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5CF5761725BAD5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422670003:1":{"text":"몸을 정화하고... 끊어졌던 연결을... 수맥과 다시 이어야 하거든요.","source_cn":"洁净身躯……将已然断绝的联系……与水脉重新接续。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7899EC27A36E2689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1422670003":{"text":"몸을 정화하고... 끊어졌던 연결을... 수맥과 다시 이어야 하거든요.","source_cn":"洁净身躯……将已然断绝的联系……与水脉重新接续。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7899EC27A36E2689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422670004:1":{"text":"타란 강은... 자비로워서... 몸을 부드럽게 떠받쳐 줄 거예요...","source_cn":"塔兰河……很仁慈……会温柔地托举他的身躯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72F16B25BFB73221","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422670005:1":{"text":"하지만 거부당하면, 그땐...","source_cn":"但，如果被拒绝，可能也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB669BBED9652ACC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422670006:1":{"text":"그땐... 제가 어떻게든 해볼게요!","source_cn":"不、不过那时……我会想办法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD30F98B2ABA086C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422670008:1":{"text":"강물에 들어가면... 고통이 느껴질 거예요...","source_cn":"浸入到河流中……会感到痛苦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31A43DB6B29D8F93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422670009:1":{"text":"끊어진 연결을 잇는 건... 아마도... 잘린 팔다리를 붙이는 것과 같은 고통일 테니까요...","source_cn":"重现连接……就像……就像将断掉的肢体重续……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA19B5BB0A1C41D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422670010:1":{"text":"반드시... 강물이 주는 고통을 견디면서... 꼭... 마음을 열어야 해요...","source_cn":"必须……要承受住河水带来的痛楚……同时……敞开心扉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C0ECD59220FEF2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422670011:1":{"text":"아무리 고통스럽더라도 받아들이겠습니다.","source_cn":"不论有多痛苦，我都会接受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFFC967D3B62EAF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422670012:1":{"text":"그리고... 강물이... 당신의 내면을 들여다볼 거예요. 저, 절대로 속이려고 하지 마세요...","source_cn":"还有一点……河流……会检验你的内心。不、不要瞒着它……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD48194F8D6840AF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422670013:1":{"text":"이건 미샤르테의 시험입니다. 당신이 신의 뜻을 어긴 대가를 정말로 이해했는지 확인하려는 거지요.","source_cn":"这是弥萨忒的考验。祂要确认你是否理解了当初违背神意的后果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27DA3D04FDFA865B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422670014:1":{"text":"저는 선조들의 선택이 잘못되었다고 생각하지는 않습니다. 하지만 그 선택의 책임을 지겠습니다. 미샤르테께... 제 결의와 진심을 증명해 보이지요.","source_cn":"我并不认为祖先们的选择有错，但我愿意为族人承担责任。我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x804F99AAB29C3FC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422670015:1":{"text":"두려워하지... 마세요... 아플 순 있지만... 타란 강은 절대 당신을... 해치지 않아요... 저도 곁에서... 지켜드릴게요...","source_cn":"不要……害怕……虽然痛苦……但塔兰河不会伤害……我会…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97D35C543A92F0BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422670016:1":{"text":"준비됐습니다. 시작하시죠.","source_cn":"我准备好了，开始吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2512C815E779251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"인듀어가 수영을 할 줄 알까?","source_cn":"因度厄会游泳吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC1E50A67FA78A76","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"인듀어가 수영을 할 줄 알까?","female":"인듀어가 수영을 할 줄 알까?","variant_male_record_index":"72994","variant_female_record_index":"72995","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422670007:1":{"text":"네, 네... 단순히 강에 들어가는 것만으로는... 시험이라고 할 수 없거든요.","source_cn":"是、是的……如果只是泡在河里……是无法构成考验的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA473A175C9C07BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"그렇게 쉬워?","source_cn":"那么简单吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x798340ECB2D76901","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그렇게 쉬워?","female":"그렇게 쉬워?","variant_male_record_index":"72996","variant_female_record_index":"72997","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊温":{"text":"휴윈","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":3}}